+## Subtopics
+
+### Temporal Sensitivity Pruning
+Prunes splats based on temporal consistency in video sequences. Choose when rendering dynamic scenes. [Temporal Sensitivity Pruning](6350-temporal-sensitivity-pruning.md)
+
+### Opacity Split for Cloning
+Splits splats with high opacity to increase density. Choose when detail is lacking. [Opacity Split for Cloning](9694-opacity-split-for-cloning.md)
+
+### GRay Optimization Settings
+Optimizes gray-scale components for specific material types. Choose for metallic or gray-scale dominant scenes. [GRay Optimization Settings](10037-gray-optimization-settings.md)
+
+### Opacity Reset & Densification Trigger
+Resets opacity to trigger densification in under-represented areas. Choose when reconstruction is incomplete. [Opacity Reset & Densification Trigger](10759-opacity-reset-densification-trigger.md)
+
+### Spatially Constrained Optimization
+Constrains optimization to local neighborhoods. Choose for large-scale scenes to reduce memory. [Spatially Constrained Optimization](13691-spatially-constrained-optimization.md)
